# Strategy, kept OUT of a public repo on purpose (2026-10-02). PRODUCT.md holds the roadmap
# and what was deferred and why, and docs/superpowers/plans/ holds every feature broken down
# before it was built. That is the material a competitor would actually want, and far more
# than the source. The canonical copies now live in the Obsidian vault, under
# Projects/FamilyRecipes/product/ and Projects/FamilyRecipes/plans/, which is private and
# already the home for this project's durable notes.
#
# The specs in docs/superpowers/specs/ are deliberately STILL TRACKED: they explain why the
# code is shaped the way it is, which is what makes the public repo worth reading. Some of
# them do carry roadmap sketches, so move them too if that ever matters more than the
# explanation.
PRODUCT.md
docs/superpowers/plans/
review.diff
